WEBVTT

00:03:59.544 --> 00:04:01.369
who I discovered through my research

00:04:01.393 --> 00:04:02.872
who love performing.

00:04:02.896 --> 00:04:04.600
You know, they love being onstage,

00:04:04.624 --> 00:04:06.970
and for them, that's
the real comfort zone.

00:04:06.994 --> 00:04:09.143
You talk to comedians and actors,

00:04:09.167 --> 00:04:12.181
and lots of them will tell you
that they're really comfortable

00:04:12.205 --> 00:04:14.634
when they're up onstage
doing their prescribed role,

00:04:14.658 --> 00:04:18.250
and then the minute they step off
and have to mingle at the cocktail party,

00:04:18.274 --> 00:04:20.302
that's when the discomfort comes for them.

00:04:20.326 --> 00:04:23.025
CA: Well, you're in control
in that situation.

00:04:23.049 --> 00:04:26.197
You are not exposed to random things

00:04:26.221 --> 00:04:29.417
that you don't know
where you might take you, it's --

00:04:29.441 --> 00:04:30.669
you own the stage.